      550   DEFINE VARIABLE dc-status AS CHARACTER
      551        VIEW-AS SELECTION-LIST SINGLE SCROLLBAR-VERTICAL
      552        LIST-ITEMS "1"
      553        SIZE 13.9 BY 2.03 NO-UNDO.
